/// Represents a Terraform/OpenTofu provider.
///
/// Base provider configuration.
abstract module tf.Provider

/// For using the same provider with different configurations for different resources.
///
/// You can optionally define multiple configurations for the same provider, and select which one to use on
/// a per-resource or per-module basis.
/// The primary reason for this is to support multiple regions for a cloud platform; other examples include
/// targeting multiple Docker hosts, multiple Consul hosts, etc.
/// See [documentation](https://www.terraform.io/language/providers/configuration#alias-multiple-provider-configurations).
alias: String?
